### =========================================================================
### Lab 02: REST Client Requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
###
### Unified Workflow: GET All -> GET 1 -> POST 11 -> PUT 11 -> DELETE 11
### =========================================================================

### 1. GET all books (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 2. GET single book by ID (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

### 3. POST - Add new book (Expected: 201 Created -> returns bookId: 11)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "author": "Andrew Hunt & David Thomas",
  "price": 550,
  "pages": 352
}

### 4. PUT - Update the newly added book ID 11 (Expected: 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/11/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer (20th Anniversary Edition)",
  "author": "David Thomas & Andrew Hunt",
  "price": 600,
  "pages": 360
}

### 5. DELETE - Remove the newly added book ID 11 (Expected: 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/11/

### 6. GET Nonexistent Book (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999/

### 7. GET Invalid ID format (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/abc/

### 8. DELETE Nonexistent Book (Expected: 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/999/
